WEBVTT

00:57:57.784 --> 00:58:00.249
and our theme music
is by Allison Leyton-Brown.

00:58:01.628 --> 00:58:05.104
In our next episode,
I talk with David Deutsch,

00:58:05.128 --> 00:58:08.049
a physicist and personal hero of mine.

00:58:08.073 --> 00:58:10.643
We talk mostly about knowledge,

00:58:10.667 --> 00:58:13.627
why he believes its power is unlimited,

00:58:13.651 --> 00:58:18.068
and what that idea might mean
for our collective future.

00:58:18.092 --> 00:58:21.471
David Deutsch: ... the only thing
that can prevent, let's say,

00:58:21.495 --> 00:58:25.951
a spaceship from earth reaching
from something a hundred light years away

00:58:25.975 --> 00:58:28.684
is the question of whether
we want to do this.

00:58:28.708 --> 00:58:31.662
We may decide not to,
in which case, we won't do it.